** The other tricky part of the combo is right before the handshake tag. You have to handshake tag as close to the startup of the preceding {{input| j. S2}} as possible or else Yasuo's wallbounce ({{input| 2S1~2H}} won't connect. Be careful not to tag too early, or the {{input| j. S2}} won't even come out.
